OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786124904
OL,3,CLaw student charged over intercepted
OL,4,Cbomb appears in court
OL,6,FA law student charged in relation to a
OL,7,Fbomb intercepted in a car near the
OL,8,FIrish border has appeared in court.
OL,10,FIsobella Perrie Sullivan, 25, of
OL,11,FAbbeylands Park, Clane, Co Kildare,
OL,12,Fhad previously been granted bail after
OL,13,Fbeing charged with possession of
OL,14,Fexplosives.
OL,16,FMs Perrie Sullivan attended a brief
OL,17,Fhearing at Monaghan District Court on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,20,FShe stood when her case was called.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/3
