PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786124904
OL,3,CLaw student charged over intercepted
OL,4,Cbomb appears in court
OL,6,FThe matter was adjourned until
OL,7,FSeptember 28 after a garda officer
OL,8,Fsaid the DPP is waiting for updates.
OL,10,FAt a previous hearing, her defence
OL,11,Fsolicitor said she had been asked to
OL,12,Ftake a bag to the north and had not
OL,13,Fbeen aware what was in it, adding that
OL,14,Fshe had been "manipulated".
OL,16,FThe car was stopped on the N2 at
OL,17,FAclint, Carrickmacross, Co Monaghan,
OL,18,Fin July.
OL,26,@vD@NOUvD@ZO]
