PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786124904
OL,3,CLaw student charged over intercepted
OL,4,Cbomb appears in court
OL,6,FDuring a search of the vehicle, a bag
OL,7,Fwas discovered in the rear seat that
OL,8,Fcontained an amount of Semtex military
OL,9,Fgrade explosive and a detonator.
OL,11,FIn court previously, Ms Perrie
OL,12,FSullivan was granted bail with
OL,13,Fconditions, including that she not
OL,14,Fhave any contact with anyone in
OL,15,FSaoradh or the New IRA.
